COMPILATION OF: E48E6

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

  14 c        if line then k = 1;
BIT REQ                ?
    1 ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48E6

   1 a 0000 E48E6:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2e] truthiness of an internal CHARACTER VARYING
   4 a 0006      member used as a bare condition -- the E46K14 shape with a
   5 a 0006      fresh module name.  NO golden of ANY program in this
   6 a 0006      repository tests a character operand without a compare, so
   7 a 0006      this probe decides whether my named refusal is a DR rule (dr-
   8 a 0006      refuses) or a gap (my-gap). */
   9 c 0006   dcl
  10 c 0006     1 rec,
  11 c 0006       2 line char(14) varying,
  12 c 0006       2 nxt fixed bin(15);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if line then k = 1;
  15 c 0025   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 0047   stop;
  17 a 004A end E48E6;

CODE SIZE = 004A
DATA AREA = 0015
FREE SYMS = 3891
END  COMPILATION
